xx.xxxxx.m.xxxxxxxx
xx.xxxxx.m.xxxxxxxx
xx.......x........@
xxxxmmxxxxxxxmmxxxx
@........x.......xx
xxxxxxxx.m.xxxxx.xx
xxxxxxxx.m.xxxxx.xx
xxxxxxxx.x....xx..@
xxxxxxxx.xxxx.xxxxx
xxxxxxxx@xxxx.xxxxx
ENDMAP
